  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Setting up a &apos;&apos;one-stop shop&apos;&apos; advisory service &amp; undertaking a baseline survey</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed actions should support Activity 2.2 to establish a one-stop-shop advisory service for potential investors covering technical, economic and legislative aspects in the aquaculture sector;  and Activity 2.4 Conducting a survey to update the national aquaculture database  to better inform sector status planning and reporting for public and private sector actors.</narrative>
  </description>
